# id manifest for neovim-glsl.spec @ 0.11.
#
# Names and kinds only. Statements stay in the spec: this file exists so a
# worktree that cannot read spec-system can still check that TRACEABILITY.md
# covers every id, and duplicating the statements would create a second place
# for them to drift. Retired ids are included, because a retired pin keeps its
# row in the table.

